tps://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ282000/RJ281809_img_smp5_100x100.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ282000/RJ281809_img_smp6_100x100.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ282000/RJ281809_img_smp7_100x100.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ282000/RJ281809_img_smp8_100x100.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ282000/RJ281809_img_smp9_100x100.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ282000/RJ281809_img_smp10_100x100.jpg"], "alt": "LiDiA エモーショナルアドベンチャー【英語版】 [ラボゲームスタジオ]"}, "introductions": [{"type": "text", "title": "An action adventure game, with the theme of unconscious.", "body": [{"intro": "Game Official Website:<br />\n<a href=\"http://labogamestudio.main.jp/lidia/index-en.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://labogamestudio.main.jp/lidia/index-en.html</a><br />\n<br />\nDo you know that there is 95% of \"You\" that you have never met before?<br />\n<br />\nIt is a vast existence called the \"unconsciousness.\"<br />\n<br />\nIt's not just supporting your physical condition and feelings.<br />\n<br />\nIt knows your character, your taste, or specialty.<br />\n<br />\nAnd how you should live from now on; it knows everything inside you that even you don't know.<br />\n<br />\nIt remembers all the nostalgia you've had since you were born.<br />\n<br />\nIt's the \"unconscious sea\" inside of you.<br />\n<br />\nMemories that you didn't know before you were born.<br />\n<br />\nThe \"collective unconsciousness\" lies deep within your memories. <br />\n<br />\nWith modern science, no one can yet see that world.<br />\n<br />\nBut maybe, somewhere, a lab has a device in place to see the unconscious sea right now."}]}, {"type": "image", "title": "We still do not know the unconscious world.", "body": [{"intro": "", "image_info": {"url": "//img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/parts/RJ282000/RJ281809/6f327986c01ff6c23b6d12cf940368d7.jpg", "alt": "LiDiA エモーショナルアドベンチャー【英語版】 [ラボゲームスタジオ]", "title": "LiDiA エモーショナルアドベンチャー【英語版】 [ラボゲームスタジオ]"}, "position": "over"}]}, {"type": "image", "title": "Game Highlights", "body": [{"intro": "", "image_info": {"url": "//img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/parts/RJ282000/RJ281809/2dc521c9c5595010f712b58f3a0f3632.jpg", "alt": "LiDiA エモーショナルアドベンチャー【英語版】 [ラボゲームスタジオ]", "title": "LiDiA エモーショナルアドベンチャー【英語版】 [ラボゲームスタジオ]"}, "position": "over"}]}, {"type": "image", "title": "The world of the mind will be elucidated by science someday.", "body": [{"intro": "", "image_info": {"url": "//img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/parts/RJ282000/RJ281809/74ff3aeddd1a092d5e011872ed8523d3.jpg", "alt": "LiDiA エモーショナルアドベンチャー【英語版】 [ラボゲームスタジオ]", "title": "LiDiA エモーショナルアドベンチャー【英語版】 [ラボゲームスタジオ]"}, "position": "over"}]}], "description": "An action adventure game, with the theme of connection with others which we desire in our hearts. Why don't you take a look at the sea of cognition which you can only enjoy in the game while being freaking out?", "short_introduction": "An action adventure game, with the theme of connection with others which we desire in our hearts. Why don't you take a look at the sea of cognition which you can only enjoy in the game while being freaking out?", "url": "https://www.dlsite.com/maniax/work/=/product_id/RJ281809.html", "site_id": "home", "fetched_at": 1794961543}